            "review_title": "Review at Grill Seibu",
            "review_text": "TanjungBaraDiver\nHanoi, Vietnam1974 contributions\n0\nGreat service and ambience.\nMar 2025 • Couples\nI must have walked past this a hundred times but only just noticed it as we moved into the area. It has excellent ambience and customer service - staff were almost too attentive. We booked and got a small circular room that looks out over the road (not really much of a view but nice all the same). The T-bone was a fair size but not overly flaversome and the lamb chops/cutlets were a bit chewy but overall the food was good. The deep fried oysters were excellent. Worth a look, and the rest of the menu looked pretty good too.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nBook the separate room if you're having a couples/date night.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 18, 2025",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
